              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tina Wiggins"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved these. They were so incredibly easy and fast. I did make a few changes. I doubled the vanilla, skipped the jam, and used about a 1/4 c heavy cream instead of the evaporated milk. They were lovely. Let them cool until just barely warm and then served with a scoop of ice cream. They were a huge hit!",
